# Benchmark: count the solutions of 12 queens with `queens` from
# examples/n-queens.chasm. Run as
# `chasm run examples/n-queens.chasm bench/n-queens.chasm`.
# Prints the checksum, then the nanoseconds the work took.

: main ( -- )
  now :> t0
  12 queens :> count
  now t0 i64.sub :> ns
  count i32.to-str print " " print ns i64.to-str println ;
